    {"type":"text","id":"summarytext","x":210,"y":914,"width":1175,"height":70,"text":"总反应式：6CO₂ + 6H₂O + 光能 → C₆H₁₂O₆ + 6O₂\n课堂记忆：光反应负责“吸光、放氧、制 ATP / NADPH”；卡尔文循环负责“固定 CO₂、造有机物”。\n本质：把太阳能转化为稳定储存在化学键中的化学能。","originalText":"总反应式：6CO₂ + 6H₂O + 光能 → C₆H₁₂O₆ + 6O₂\n课堂记忆：光反应负责“吸光、放氧、制 ATP / NADPH”；卡尔文循环负责“固定 CO₂、造有机物”。\n本质：把太阳能转化为稳定储存在化学键中的化学能。","fontSize":24,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":3054,"version":1,"versionNonce":4054,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
